                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The following compilation presents documentation on the relationship between the
                    United States and the United Kingdom following World War II, indicating the
                    stresses which that relationship underwent during 1951, but attempts to document
                    only bilateral aspects. Consultations between the two powers on third countries
                    or on topics involving other countries is presented in the compilations on those
                    subjects. In general, the documentation that follows has been annotated to
                    indicate where further information on these topics can be found.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
